  "bio": "Adrian Rothson is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Cagliari, Italy, renowned for his mastery in black and gray realism and chicano styles. His artwork exhibits a nuanced interplay of shadows and details, bringing each piece to life with a breathtaking sense of depth. Attention to hygiene is paramount in Adrian's studio, ensuring a clean and safe environment for all his clients.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Cagliari, Sardinia, Italy\n\nAdrian Rothson • Tatuatore dal 1994\n•REALISTIC TATTOO \n•CHICANO TATTOO \n📍Sardegna-Cagliari 🇮🇹\nPrecursore dello stile #chicano in Europa",
